flowchart TD
  R[Post owner selects eligible offer or interest] --> Q[Create protected payment request]
  Q --> S[Sender views Payment history]
  S --> U[Send transfer and upload proof]
  U --> V[Status: payment verifying]
  V --> A[Authorized administrator reviews proof]
  A -->|Reject| X[Return to payment request with reason]
  A -->|Verify| M[Protected match opens]
  M --> D[Traveler updates delivery progress]
  D --> L[Sender confirms receipt and release]
  L --> P[Traveler payout becomes due]
  P --> Z[Administrator records payout sent]
  Z --> F[Traveler confirms payout received]
